WEBVTT

00:10:29.083 --> 00:10:30.668
versus other markets,

00:10:30.668 --> 00:10:34.171
and it has the opportunity
to do things differently and better.

00:10:34.672 --> 00:10:37.800
By using marketing
and a demand-led approach,

00:10:37.841 --> 00:10:40.594
Africa can boost economic growth,

00:10:40.636 --> 00:10:43.847
reduce incidences of diet-related diseases

00:10:43.889 --> 00:10:46.975
and adapt to the challenges
of climate change.

00:10:47.309 --> 00:10:48.519
Got millet?

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:51.063
(Laughter and applause)

00:10:51.105 --> 00:10:52.356
Thank you.